# D3-TR-005: Temperature can be transported without a reacting solute
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
new
new
new
add v1 water 20mL @ 20C
add v2 water 20mL @ 20C
add v3 water 20mL @ 20C
add v4 water 20mL @ 50C
add v6 water 20mL @ 20C
transport v1 v2 v3 from v4 to v5 steps 1 courant 0.5
measure v1 thermometer
measure v2 thermometer
measure v3 thermometer
transport v1 v2 v3 from v6 to v5 steps 6 courant 0.5
measure v1 thermometer
measure v3 thermometer
measure v5 thermometer
inspect
